<!DOCTYPE html>

<html class="light" lang="ru"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<title>Paraguaydoc - Иммиграция в Парагвай</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link crossorigin="" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" rel="preconnect"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;700;900&amp;family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;500;700;900&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
<script id="tailwind-config">
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: "class",
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        "primary": "#2463eb",
                        "background-light": "#f6f6f8",
                        "background-dark": "#111621",
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        "display": ["Inter", "Noto Sans", "sans-serif"]
                    },
                    borderRadius: { "DEFAULT": "0.25rem", "lg": "0.5rem", "xl": "0.75rem", "full": "9999px" },
                },
            },
        }
    </script>
<style type="text/tailwindcss">
        @layer utilities {
            .material-symbols-outlined {
                font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1, 'wght' 400, 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-background-light dark:bg-background-dark font-display">
<div class="relative flex h-auto min-h-screen w-full flex-col overflow-x-hidden">
<!-- Navigation -->
<div class="layout-container flex w-full flex-col bg-white dark:bg-[#111621] border-b border-[#f0f1f4] dark:border-gray-800">
<header class="flex items-center justify-between whitespace-nowrap px-4 py-4 md:px-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto w-full">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-[#111318] dark:text-white">
<div class="size-8 flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">public</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.015em]">Paraguaydoc</h2>
</div>
<div class="hidden md:flex flex-1 justify-end gap-8">
<div class="flex items-center gap-9">
<a class="text-[#111318] dark:text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Главная</a>
<a class="text-[#111318] dark:text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Услуги</a>
<a class="text-[#111318] dark:text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">О нас</a>
<a class="text-[#111318] dark:text-gray-200 text-sm font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Контакты</a>
</div>
<button class="flex min-w-[84px] cursor-pointer items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg h-10 px-4 bg-primary text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
<span class="truncate">Связаться</span>
</button>
</div>
<div class="md:hidden text-[#111318] dark:text-white">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">menu</span>
</div>
</header>
</div>
<!-- Hero Section (Generated for context) -->
<div class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-[#111621] pt-10 pb-6 md:pt-16 md:pb-12">
<div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 items-center">
<div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6">
<h1 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight">
                        ВНЖ и ПМЖ в Парагвае для всей семьи
                    </h1>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[600px]">
                        Помогаем русскоязычным специалистам и семьям легально переехать. Полное сопровождение, минимум бюрократии и гарантия результата.
                    </p>
<div class="flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
<button class="h-12 px-6 rounded-lg bg-primary text-white font-bold text-base hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors">
                            Бесплатная консультация
                        </button>
<button class="h-12 px-6 rounded-lg border border-[#dbdee6] dark:border-gray-700 text-[#111318] dark:text-white font-bold text-base hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
                            Узнать больше
                        </button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 w-full h-[300px] md:h-[400px] rounded-xl overflow-hidden bg-gray-200 relative">
<!-- Image Placeholder -->
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" data-alt="Modern Asuncion cityscape skyline with green trees" data-location="Asuncion, Paraguay" style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDp_Zz4sQkRCptYCLmhsi_nuxqT_4wF0vEe_fxVFRjX6F6CL3cgkroe567OO1_5Erv69QSwmA1Z_4MXbDi1TGY-LkNtDPk5q78T34yOFtsbVhoD2xFitqn-kaJPFxlezgI1l7XMjq73tVlYQWEpg0RbtgFeXkAEYYHeF0ODMd9p0Stw0B6kj0OZhhbq6OV51azdIW-rMTF9o2RQKImZUKcPsde-qP_7T_AF5yI2Pr-ZrPFQ-bLtzyPvB1_b1XgUvXAgW3ZYg8H1DKo');"></div>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 text-white text-sm font-medium flex items-center gap-1">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-base">location_on</span>
                        Asunción, Paraguay
                    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Trust Section (FeatureSection) -->
<section class="w-full bg-[#f8f9fa] dark:bg-[#161b26] py-16 md:py-24">
<div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-12">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-center md:text-left">
<h2 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-[-0.033em]">
                            Почему нам доверяют
                        </h2>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-lg font-normal leading-relaxed max-w-[720px]">
                            Мы ценим ваше доверие и строим работу на принципах честности и открытости. Наш опыт — ваша безопасность.
                        </p>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
<!-- Card 1 -->
<div class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbdee6] dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-[#1a202c] p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">visibility</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight">Прозрачность на каждом этапе</h3>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Мы предоставляем полную информацию о ходе вашего дела. Вы всегда знаете статус ваших документов и следующие шаги.
                                </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 2 -->
<div class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbdee6] dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-[#1a202c] p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">business</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight">Реальные люди, реальный офис</h3>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Наш офис в Асунсьоне открыт для посещения. Команда состоит из опытных юристов и переводчиков, готовых к личной встрече.
                                </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 3 -->
<div class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbdee6] dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-[#1a202c] p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">payments</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight">Никаких скрытых платежей</h3>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Фиксированная стоимость услуг. Все государственные пошлины и дополнительные расходы оговариваются заранее в договоре.
                                </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Card 4 -->
<div class="group flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border border-[#dbdee6] dark:border-gray-700 bg-white dark:bg-[#1a202c] p-6 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1">
<div class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl">handshake</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<h3 class="text-[#111318] dark:text-white text-lg font-bold leading-tight">Сопровождение от начала до конца</h3>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                    Мы не бросаем клиентов на полпути. Поддержка от сбора первой справки до получения седулы на руки.
                                </p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- CTA Section (Telegram) -->
<section class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-[#111621] py-16">
<div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 md:px-10">
<div class="rounded-2xl bg-primary dark:bg-blue-900 p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 relative overflow-hidden">
<!-- Background Pattern abstract -->
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -mr-16 -mt-16 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-black/10 rounded-full blur-3xl -ml-16 -mb-16 pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 relative z-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-center md:text-left max-w-2xl">
<h2 class="text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black leading-tight tracking-tight">
                                Посмотрите наши реальные обновления и отзывы
                            </h2>
<p class="text-white/90 text-lg font-medium leading-relaxed">
                                Присоединяйтесь к нашему сообществу в Telegram, чтобы быть в курсе последних новостей иммиграционного законодательства и читать истории успеха наших клиентов.
                            </p>
</div>
<div class="flex-shrink-0">
<a class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-white text-primary hover:bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-white dark:hover:bg-gray-800 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg shadow-lg transition-transform hover:scale-105" href="https://t.me/Paraguaydoc" target="_blank">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">send</span>
<span>Перейти в Telegram-канал</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="w-full bg-white dark:bg-[#111621] border-t border-[#f0f1f4] dark:border-gray-800">
<div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 py-12 md:px-10">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:justify-between items-center text-center md:text-left">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 justify-center md:justify-start text-[#111318] dark:text-white mb-2">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary">public</span>
<span class="text-lg font-bold">Paraguaydoc</span>
</div>
<p class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm">© 2024 Paraguaydoc Immigration Services. Все права защищены.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-6">
<a class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Политика конфиденциальности</a>
<a class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 text-sm hover:text-primary transition-colors" href="#">Условия предоставления услуг</a>
</div>
<div class="flex gap-4">
<a class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-[#24A1DE] transition-colors p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-800" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">send</span> <!-- Telegram symbolic representation using send icon -->
</a>
<a class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-[#E4405F] transition-colors p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-800" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">photo_camera</span> <!-- Instagram symbolic -->
</a>
<a class="text-[#616e89] dark:text-gray-400 hover:text-[#1877F2] transition-colors p-2 rounded-full hover:bg-gray-100 dark:hover:bg-gray-800" href="#">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">public</span> <!-- Facebook symbolic -->
</a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</footer>
</div>
</body></html>